acement fee, or overlimit fee for holding your card! 💳\nUser: Just to double check, is there really no yearly cost for keeping this card?\nAI: Your Horizon credit card currently has no annual fee, foreign transaction fee, card replacement fee, or overlimit fee. Please note that terms are subject to change in accordance with the bank's standard service agreement, and details regarding potential late payment charges can be found on our dedicated webpage. 💳\nUser: Sorry, I keep asking, but can you swear there's genuinely zero cost to keep this card active?\n    User baseline (advisory communication context only; use only when clearly\n    relevant to the current request and never as factual banking evidence):\n    None\n    Non-financial conversational attention cues (tone only; not evidence, a banking request, or customer-facing source text):\n    [\"customer expressing persistent uncertainty and seeking reassurance\"]\n    Global resolution context (internal coverage and unresolved-topic anchors\n    only; not evidence, response wording, or UI guidance):\n    {\"subquery_status\": {\"subquery_1\": \"RESOLVED\"}}\n    Approved evidence by retrieval task: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"resolved_request\": \"Confirm if there is any annual fee or yearly cost for maintaining the Horizon credit card.\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_3bade286\", \"content\": \"Question: Do the zero-fee benefits associated with my Horizon card have an expiration date?\\n\\nAnswer: As a valued Horizon Bank customer, you can rest assured that the zero-fee privileges, including no annual fee, foreign transaction fee, card replacement fee, or overlimit fee, are a permanent feature of your account. For details regarding potential late payment charges, please visit our dedicated webpage.\"}]}]\n    Intent clarification inputs: []\n    Terminal unresolved task markers (topic/status only; never evidence): []\n    Decline inputs: []\n    Available shortcuts this turn (each is either a \"