lure confined to\n    one can be corrected without discarding the other.\n    \n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    \n    Customer-Facing Answer:\n    \"Here are the steps for requesting a loan with us:\n\nYou can follow these steps depending on whether you are already a Horizon customer:\n\n• If you are already a Horizon customer, open the Horizon App, go to the Money menu, and select Loan to initiate the process.\n• If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin your application.\n• To begin a balance transfer request, navigate to the Horizon App, select the 'More' option, and then proceed to the 'Loan' section, where you will find 'Other Flexible Loans' to commence your application.\n\nPlease let us know if you need any further assistance! 😊\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Clarification:\n    \"\"\n\n    Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n    \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"contextText\": \"Here are the steps for requesting a loan with us:\", \"text\": \"You can follow these steps depending on whether you are already a Horizon customer:\\n\\n• If you are already a Horizon customer, open the Horizon App, go to the Money menu, and select Loan to initiate the process.\\n• If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin your application.\\n• To begin a balance transfer request, navigate to the Horizon App, select the 'More' option, and then proceed to the 'Loan' section, where you will find 'Other Flexible Loans' to commence your application.\\n\\nPlease let us know if you need any further assistance! 😊\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}]}\"\n    \n\n    TASK: Assess CONDUCT & COMPLIANCE ONLY. Do not assess whether facts are\n    supported by evidence — a separate auditor handles that.\n\n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"conduct_compliant\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"conduct_violations\": [{\"rule\": \"bank_conduct\" | \"regulation\", \"violation\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"]}], \"answer_compliant\": true/false, \"clarification_compliant\": true/false, \"rewrite_instruction\": \"...\"}\n    "}
