assistant\", \"content\": \"Here are the steps to apply for an Instant Loan with Horizon Bank:\\n\\nOpen the Horizon App, go to the Money menu, and select Loan to initiate the process. You will need to possess a Horizon credit card and have an adequate unused credit limit.\\n\\nDownload the Horizon App, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin your application. Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply, and every submission is subject to Horizon Bank's credit-worthiness assessment.\\n\\nTo request a credit facility, you need to be aged between 21 and 65 years. Your annual income must be at least S$30,000 if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident, or at least S$60,000 if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass. 😊\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"can you give more detail on applying for the loan\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Here is more detailed information regarding the criteria and process for applying for an Instant Loan with Horizon Bank: 😊\\n\\nFor current Horizon Bank clients, you need to possess a Horizon credit card and have an adequate unused credit limit. \\n\\nFor new applicants, Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply, and every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit-worthiness assessment.\\n\\nTo request a credit facility, you need to be aged between 21 and 65 years. Your annual income must be at least S$30,000 if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident, or at least S$60,000 if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\\n\\nTo apply, current customers can open the Horizon App, go to the Money menu, and select Loan to initiate the process. New applicants can download the Horizon App, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin the application.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"i am still not clear, please explain the loan application ste