onfined to\n    one can be corrected without discarding the other.\n    \n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    \n    Customer-Facing Answer:\n    \"I understand you are looking into applying for a specialized custody escrow arrangement.\n\nAt this time, we do not have specific information or manual steps available in our system regarding the application process for a specialized custody escrow arrangement. 🤝\n\nIf you would like to discuss specialized account options or need further assistance with your banking needs, please feel free to reach out to our support team.\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Clarification:\n    \"\"\n\n    Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n    \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"contextText\": \"I understand you are looking into applying for a specialized custody escrow arrangement.\", \"text\": \"At this time, we do not have specific information or manual steps available in our system regarding the application process for a specialized custody escrow arrangement. 🤝\\n\\nIf you would like to discuss specialized account options or need further assistance with your banking needs, please feel free to reach out to our support team.\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}]}\"\n    \n\n    TASK: Assess CONDUCT & COMPLIANCE ONLY. Do not assess whether facts are\n    supported by evidence — a separate auditor handles that.\n\n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"conduct_compliant\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"conduct_violations\": [{\"rule\": \"bank_conduct\" | \"regulation\", \"violation\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"]}], \"answer_compliant\": true/false, \"clarification_compliant\": true/f