onfined to\n    one can be corrected without discarding the other.\n    \n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    \n    Customer-Facing Answer:\n    \"I'd be happy to help explain how you can apply for a loan with Horizon Bank! 😊\n\nThe steps to request an Instant Loan depend on whether you are currently a client:\n\n• **For current Horizon Bank clients:** Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to start. You will need to possess a Horizon credit card and have an adequate unused credit limit.\n• **For new applicants:** Download the Horizon App, navigate to **Product Selection**, and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application. Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply. Every submission is subject to Horizon Bank’s credit-worthiness assessment, and you must meet the age and minimum annual income requirements.\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Clarification:\n    \"\"\n\n    Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n    \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"contextText\": \"I'd be happy to help explain how you can apply for a loan with Horizon Bank! 😊\", \"text\": \"The steps to request an Instant Loan depend on whether you are currently a client:\\n\\n• **For current Horizon Bank clients:** Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to start. You will need to possess a Horizon credit card and have an adequate unused credit limit.\\n• **For new applicants:** Download the Horizon App, navigate to **Product Selection**, and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application. Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply. Every submission is subject to Horizon Bank’s credit-worthiness assessment, and you must meet the age and minimum annual income requirements.\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}]}\"\n    \n\n    TASK: Assess CONDUCT & COMPLIANCE ONLY. Do not assess whether facts are\n    supported by evidence — a separate auditor handles that.\n\n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"conduct_compliant\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"conduct_violations\": [{\"rule\": \"bank_conduct\" | \"regulation\", \"violation\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"]}], \"answer_compliant\": true/false, \"clarification_compliant\": true/false, \"rewrite_instruction\": \"...\"}\n    "}
