 any late‑payment penalties or interest charges are applied exclusively to the main cardholder.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_df0e6cbd\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the charges associated with withdrawing cash using my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: As of {{faq_df0e6cbd_001}} February {{faq_df0e6cbd_002}}, Horizon Bank imposes a cash advance fee of {{faq_df0e6cbd_003}} on the withdrawn amount, although transactions below {{faq_df0e6cbd_004}} are exempt from this charge. Additionally, a daily interest rate of {{faq_df0e6cbd_005}} (equivalent to {{faq_df0e6cbd_006}} per annum) is applied to the withdrawn amount, starting from the transaction posting date until the payment is made in full. Please note that from {{faq_df0e6cbd_007}} July {{faq_df0e6cbd_008}}, your Effective Interest Rate will be tailored to your individual credit profile, ranging from {{faq_df0e6cbd_009}} to {{faq_df0e6cbd_010}} per annum.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_f89201b7\", \"content\": \"Question: What charges can I expect when using my Horizon Bank Visa Instalment plan?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we maintain transparency with our pricing. You won't incur a one-time fee for using our Visa Instalments, and as part of our commitment to clarity, we do not charge hidden fees or early repayment fees.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task 