{"timestamp": "2026-08-26T06:45:01.333+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_94343dac-d7ac-416b-afc5-3bc156b42cef", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): can my credit card share the credit limit of the loan?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil your request using the form below.\nUser: what is the annual fee for my business credit card\nAI: Hello! As a valued Horizon Bank customer, you can enjoy zero-fee privileges on your business credit card, which include no annual fee, foreign transaction fee, card replacement fee, or overlimit fee as a permanent feature of your account 🎉. For details regarding potential late payment charges, please visit our dedicated webpage.\nUser: how to apply for a loan\nAI: Hello! 🌟 To request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank, you can follow these simple steps depending on whether you are already a customer:\n\n- If you are a current Horizon Bank client, open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to start.\n- If you are new to Horizon, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\n\nTo qualify for a credit facility, you need to meet a few basic criteria: you must be aged between 21 and 65 years, and have an annual income of at least S$30,000 if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident, or at least S$60,000 if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass. Current clients also need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit, while new applicants are subject to a credit-worthiness assessment.\nUser: what about it\nAI: Hello! 😊 To help clarify regarding the Instant Loan, here are the details on who qualifies and how to apply based on your situation:\n\n- **For current Horizon Bank clients:** You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have an adequate unused credit limit.\n- **For new applicants:** Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply, and every submission is subject to Horizon Bank's credit-worthiness assessment.\n\nAdditionally, you must meet these basic criteria:\n- You must be aged between 21 and 65 years.\n- Your annual income must be at least S$30,000 if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\n- Your annual income must be at least S$60,000 if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\n\nTo request an Instant Loan, current clients can open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan**. If you are new to Horizon, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\nUser: can my credit card share the credit limit of the loan?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Manage credit limits by accessing the account dashboard within the mobile application settings menu\", \"policy\": \"Credit limits for personal loans are independent and do not share balances with credit card accounts\", \"conceptual\": \"An Instant Loan functions as a separate credit facility with its own distinct approved credit limit\", \"target_commerc