e Horizon App's in-app chat service, specifying 'fee waiver' in your query. Our team will carefully review your request and provide an update via push notification within {{faq_25ce7c68_001}} working days.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e5db6d91\", \"content\": \"Question: Are there any fees associated with obtaining a supplementary Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank does not levy any issuance or annual fees for an additional card. All expenses incurred on the supplementary card are combined with the primary card’s balance, and any late‑payment penalties or interest charges are applied exclusively to the main cardholder.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_df0e6cbd\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the charges associated with withdrawing cash using my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: As of {{faq_df0e6cbd_001}} February {{faq_df0e6cbd_002}}, Horizon Bank imposes a cash advance fee of {{faq_df0e6cbd_003}} on the withdrawn amount, although transactions below {{faq_df0e6cbd_004}} are exempt from this charge. Additionally, a daily interest rate of {{faq_df0e6cbd_005}} (equivalent to {{faq_df0e6cbd_006}} per annum) is applied to the withdrawn amount, starting from the transaction posting date until the payment is made in full. Please note that from {{faq_df0e6cbd_007}} July {{faq_df0e6cbd_008}}, your Effective Interest Rate will be tailored to your individual credit profile, ranging from {{faq_df0e6cbd_009}} to {{faq_df0e6cbd_010}} per annum.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history 