Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Transaction Disputes\", \"Branch And ATM Locator\"], \"customer_component\": \"Inquiry regarding the annual fee for the personal credit card account.\", \"direct_query\": \"Inquiry regarding the annual fee for the personal credit card account.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Review your monthly statement to identify the specific annual fee charge applied to your account.\", \"policy\": \"Annual fees are charged once per year on the anniversary of your credit card account opening.\", \"conceptual\": \"An annual fee is a recurring cost for maintaining your credit card account and its associated benefits.\"}, {\"group_id\": \"retry_4\", \"procedural\": \"Check your account status to confirm if any annual fee waivers apply to your specific card.\", \"policy\": \"Standard debit card accounts do not incur any annual maintenance fees or recurring yearly charges.\", \"conceptual\": \"Account closure procedures do not involve any additional fees or penalties for the account holder.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss balance transfer fees, fee waiver processes, supplementary card fees, and cash advance fees, but none provide information regarding the annual fee for a standard personal credit card account.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_e5db6d91\", \"fact\": \"Horizon Bank does not charge issuance or annual fees for supplementary credit cards.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_df0e6cbd\", \"fact\": \"Horizon Bank charges a cash advance fee of {{faq_df0e6cbd_0