izon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\\n- If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_5deed8da\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for repaying my Horizon Bank loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The loan installment is automatically posted to your Horizon credit card statement each month, and you can clear it via that statement.\\n- Open the Horizon App, navigate to Money → Credit Card, and select Pay Credit Card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"content\": \"Question: Do I qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering?\\n\\nAnswer: - **For current Horizon Bank clients:**\\n  * You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n- **For new applicants:**\\n  * Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan.\\n  * Every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\\n\\nYou may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_8984208c\", \"content\": \"Question: What charges does Horizon Bank apply to an Instant Loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - No annual fee is levied on Instant Loans that were originated before {{faq_8984208c_001}} February {{faq_8984208c_002}}.\\n- For Instant Loans opened on or after {{faq_8984208c_003}} February {{faq_8984208c_004}}:\\n  * A first‑year annual charge equal to {{faq_8984208c_005}} % of the loan amount is added to your Horizon credit card.\\n  * If the loan term is one year or longer, a {{faq_