{"timestamp": "2026-08-26T17:04:00.622+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "chip_test_1787763824", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    PRE-DECOMPOSED CUSTOMER COMPONENTS (from Triage; already screened for financial relevance and compliance): [{'component_id': 'subquery_1', 'customer_component': 'What is the annual fee for my business credit card?'}, {'component_id': 'subquery_2', 'customer_component': 'What is the process to apply for a loan?'}]\n    This list is the complete, final partition of the customer's request. Do NOT merge, split, drop, or invent components — process every one exactly as given.\n\n    PRODUCT/INTENT MATRIX (Valid Nouns and Verbs):\n    {'ALL': ['Account Management', 'Authentication And Security', 'Features And Limits', 'General Inquiries', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Rewards And Promotions'], 'Credit_Card': ['Account Management', 'Application', 'Authentication And Security', 'Card Logistics', 'Eligibility', 'Features And Limits', 'Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Interest And Rates', 'Loan And Credit Management', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Profile Updates', 'Rewards And Promotions', 'Transaction Disputes'], 'Debit_Card': ['Account Management', 'Application', 'Authentication And Security', 'Card Logistics', 'Eligibility', 'Features And Limits', 'Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Profile Updates', 'Rewards And Promotions', 'Transaction Disputes'], 'Deposit_Account': ['Account Management', 'Application', 'Authentication And Security', 'Branch And ATM Locator', 'Card Logistics', 'Eligibility', 'Features And Limits', 'Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Interest And Rates', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Profile Updates', 'Rewards And Promotions', 'Transaction Disputes'], 'Horizon_APP': ['Account Management', 'Authentication And Security', 'Features And Limits', 'General Inquiries', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Profile Updates', 'Rewards And Promotions'], 'Insurance': ['Features And Limits', 'General Inquiries', 'Rewards And Promotions', 'Wealth And Insurance'], 'Mutual_Funds': ['Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Wealth And Insurance'], 'Personal_Loan': ['Account Management', 'Application', 'Authentication And Security', 'Eligibility', 'Features And Limits', 'Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Interest And Rates', 'Loan And Credit Management', 'Rewards And Promotions'], 'Rewards_Program': ['Authentication And Security', 'Features And Limits', 'General Inquiries', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Rewards And Promotions'], 'Stocks': ['Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Wealth And Insurance']}\n\n    INTENT DEFINITION GUIDELINE:\n    \n1. Acquisition & Setup (Getting Started)\nApplication: How to apply, steps involved, document submission, or checking status. \nEligibility: Qualify for a product, income/age requirements, existing relationships. \nCard Logistics: Physical handling. Activation, delivery, reporting lost/stolen, replacement. \n2. Product Knowledge (Understanding the Asset)\nFeatures And Limits: General mechanics, benefits, usage limits, overseas use, digital wallets. \nFees And Charges: Costs, annual fees, fall-below fees, penalties, fee waivers. \nInterest And Rates: Interest accumulation, base rates, bonus criteria, payout timing. \n3. Daily Servicing (Account & Money Movement)\nAccount Management: Checking balances, dormancy, linking accounts, account cancellation. \nProfile Updates: Address, phone number, and email updates. \nPayments And Transfers: PayNow, FAST, GIRO, bill payments, cheque deposits, transfer errors. \nTransaction Disputes: Unrecognized charges, double billing, refunds, declined transactions. \n4. Specialized Financial Services\nLoan And Credit Management: Repayment schedules, installments, balance transfers, hardship. \nWealth And Insurance: Investments, stocks, mutual funds, auto-invest, insurance premiums, claims. \nRewards And Promotions: Earning points, cashback, merchant coupons, referral bonuses. \n5. Technical & General Support\nAuthentication And Security: Login issues, password/PIN resets, OTP failures, tokens, fraud. \nBranch And ATM Locator: Finding physical infrastructure. \nGeneral Inquiries: Catch-all. App navigation, UI bugs, compliance, generic notifications.\n\n\n    Active Context Matrix: []\n    Current Graph Context: active_plan=False, retrieved_knowledge=False\n    Recalled Prior-Session Context Is Available: False\n    Recent Conversation: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil your request using the form below.\n\nWould you still like to complete your Change Address request?\nUser: what is the annual fee for my business credit card. what's process to apply a loan?\n    User Baseline (advisory only; do not treat it as a current request): None\n    Latest User Input (context only; the components above are authoritative): \"what is the annual fee for my business credit card. what's process to apply a loan?\"\n    TASK: Act as a Decoupled Database Search Architect.\n\n    CRITICAL RULES FOR ANGLE QUERIES:\n    - NEVER use conversational filler (e.g., \"Provide a guide\", \"Explain how to\", \"What is\").\n    - NEVER paraphrase the customer's original question in an angle.\n    - Each angle must be a short natural-language PHRASE (8-20 words) that reads like a sentence fragment from an FAQ answer.\n    - Use common banking vocabulary only. Do not invent specific product names, amounts, dates, or branch details.\n\n    1. CONTEXTUAL INHERITANCE: Read each component's customer_component text first. A Product or Intent may be inherited only when it is unambiguously established by the current-session trusted history, Active Context Matrix, or an active graph plan. Do not use the user baseline or prior