basis in the\n      conversation. A block with an implausible, invented, or fact-asserting\n      reply chip fails even if its question text is otherwise fine.\n    - A decline must not assert a specific Horizon product, policy, fee, or\n      commitment as the reason, and must never provide the declined advice,\n      action, or information itself.\n    Valid blockIds: ['decline_decline_formulator_1']\n    \n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    blockId=\"decline_decline_formulator_1\" (decline): \"This assistant's information covers individual and personal banking only.\"\n\n    TASK: Assess CONDUCT & COMPLIANCE ONLY. Do not assess whether facts are\n    supported by evidence — a separate auditor handles that.\n\n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"conduct_compliant\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"conduct_violations\": [{\"rule\": \"bank_conduct\" | \"regulation\", \"violation\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"]}], \"non_compliant_block_ids\": [\"blockId\", \"...\"]}\n    "}
