fined to\n    one can be corrected without discarding the other.\n    \n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    \n    Customer-Facing Answer:\n    \"I can certainly help explain the steps to apply for a loan with us! 🌟\n\nHere is how you can request an Instant Loan using the Horizon App:\n\nOpen the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\n\nIf you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Clarification:\n    \"This assistant's information covers individual and personal banking only.\"\n\n    Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n    \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"stepper\", \"contextText\": \"I can certainly help explain the steps to apply for a loan with us! 🌟\\n\\nHere is how you can request an Instant Loan using the Horizon App:\", \"text\": \"\", \"items\": [{\"number\": 1, \"label\": \"Open the App\", \"detail\": \"Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\", \"status\": \"current\"}, {\"number\": 2, \"label\": \"New Customers\", \"detail\": \"If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"Instant Loan Application Steps\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": 1, \"totalSteps\": 2, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}, {\"type\": \"clarification\", \"text\": \"This assistant's information covers individual and personal banking only.\", \"options\": []}]}\"\n    \n\n    TASK: Assess CONDUCT & COMPLIANCE ONLY. Do not assess whether facts are\n    supported by evidence — a separate auditor handles that.\n\n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"conduct_compliant\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"conduct_violations\": [{\"rule\": \"bank_conduct\" | \"regulation\", \"violation\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"]}], \"answer_compliant\": true/false, \"clarification_compliant\": true/false, \"rewrite_instruction\": \"...\"}\n    "}
