riteria for both new and existing customers. However, the procedural details regarding the specific documents required for the application remain missing.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_1946c44f\", \"fact\": \"The Instant Loan application process is initiated by navigating to the Money menu and selecting Loan in the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"fact\": \"Instant Loan eligibility requires meeting specific age ranges and annual income thresholds based on residency status.\"}]}, {\"attempt\": 3, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_46c17d0e\", \"faq_1946c44f\", \"faq_0ae0bb51\"], \"reason\": \"The provided parents successfully cover the navigation steps to initiate a loan application and the eligibility criteria for both new and existing customers. However, the procedural requirement regarding specific identification and income documents remains unaddressed.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_17e5c35a\", \"content\": \"Question: Why does my Instant Loan application come with a Horizon credit card and a Horizon savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank converts a portion of the available balance on your Horizon credit card into cash and deposits those funds directly into your Horizon savings account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7b4f60c3\", \"content\": \"Question: What verification process does Horizon Bank use to confirm the accuracy of my PayNow name after an update?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we work in conjunction with the PayNow scheme operator to ensure that your PayNow name reflects your registered account name on record. This collaborative effort guarantees that rigorous checks are in place to verify the correctness of your updated PayNow name, providing you with assurance of its accuracy.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_5b37494f\", \"content\": \"Question: What should I prepare and bring when I visit a Horizon Bank Experience Centre?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you filed a